<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 2: WARM-UP + KP1 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-h1">一、Warm-Up（共 5 題，5 min）</div>

<div class="lf-game"><div class="lf-game-title">📐 幾何探險家</div><div class="lf-game-desc">計算面積&體積，小心公式陷阱！三角形要除2、梯形上下底唔好調轉！</div><div class="lf-game-action">🔍 開始探險 →</div></div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area（寫出完整計算過程）</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">1</td><td>Rectangle長 8 cm、闊 5 cm，Area = ？單位是甚麼？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">2</td><td>1 m = ？cm；1 m² = ？cm²</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">3</td><td>計算 12 × 5 × 3 = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">4</td><td>計算 7³ = ？（即 7×7×7）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿 進階</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">5</td><td>一個正方體有幾個面？每個面是甚麼形狀？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱 基礎</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h1">二、Core Knowledge ＋ Worked Examples</div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點一：Volume概念與單位（cm³ 與 m³）<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>Volume是甚麼？</strong><br/>
      ① Volume = 物體<strong>佔據空間的大小</strong>（三維：長×闊×高）<br/>
      ② 1 cm³ = 邊長 1 cm 的正方體所佔的空間（一粒骰仔咁大）<br/>
      ③ 1 m³ = 邊長 1 m 的正方體（約一個大型洗衣機的大小）<br/>
      ④ <strong>單位換算（極重要！）</strong>：1 m = 100 cm，1 m³ = 100×100×100 = <strong>1,000,000 cm³</strong><br/>
      ⑤ <strong>Area vs Volume</strong>：Area = 二維 (cm²)；Volume = 三維 (cm³)——<strong>絕對不能混淆單位！</strong>
</div>
<div style="margin:10px 0 0;text-align:center;">
<svg style="width:100%;max-width:300px;height:auto;" viewbox="0 0 300 170" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<!-- 1cm³ isometric cube -->
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="80" rx="1" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="80" x="80" y="60"></rect>
<polygon fill="#BFDBFE" points="80,60 120,30 200,30 160,60" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2"></polygon>
<polygon fill="#93C5FD" points="160,60 200,30 200,110 160,140" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2"></polygon>
<!-- Edge labels -->
<line marker-end="url(#arrowGold)" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5" x1="80" x2="160" y1="150" y2="150"></line>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="120" y="164">1 cm</text>
<line marker-end="url(#arrowGold)" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5" x1="68" x2="68" y1="140" y2="60"></line>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="56" y="104">1 cm</text>
<line marker-end="url(#arrowGold)" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5" x1="210" x2="210" y1="110" y2="30"></line>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="224" y="74">1 cm</text>
<!-- Volume label -->
<rect fill="#FEF3C7" height="22" rx="4" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1" width="48" x="95" y="83"></rect>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" x="119" y="99">1 cm³</text>
<!-- Arrow markers -->
<defs>
<marker id="arrowGold" markerheight="6" markerwidth="6" orient="auto-start-reverse" refx="9" refy="5" viewbox="0 0 10 10">
<path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#C9A84C"></path>
</marker>
</defs>
</svg>
<div style="font-size:9px;color:#6B7280;margin-top:2px;">邊長 1 cm 的正方體 → Volume = 1 cm³（三維空間的大小）</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">🪴 Trap引爆例題</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">1 m³ = ？cm³</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Common Mistake（70% 學生）</div><div class="eq">1 m³ = 100 cm³ 😅</div><div class="why">只做了 1×100，忘記三維各乘 100！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確解法</div><div class="eq">1 m³ = 100×100×100<br/>= <strong>1,000,000 cm³</strong></div><div class="why">1 m = 100 cm，三次方 → 100³</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic：「一維乘 100，二維乘一萬，三維乘一百萬——m 轉 cm 睇清楚次方！」</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 最高頻錯誤：m³ → cm³ 忘記乘 1,000,000（三次方各乘 100）</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 第二高頻錯誤：Volume用 cm² 做單位——Volume一定是「立方」單位（cm³ / m³）</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一 Worked Examples</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例1</td><td>數一數：下圖由多少個 1 cm³ 小正方體組成？（圖：2×3×2 長方體）</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例2</td><td>2 m³ = ？cm³（寫出換算步驟）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:95px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例3</td><td>3,000,000 cm³ = ？m³</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:95px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點一 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">6</td><td>邊長 1 cm 的正方體，Volume = ？單位是甚麼？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:75px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">7</td><td>1.5 m³ = ？cm³</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">8</td><td>500,000 cm³ = ？m³（以Decimal作答）</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 3: KP2 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div style="text-align:center; margin:8px 0; padding:8px; background:#F0F9FF; border:1px solid var(--borderc); border-radius:5px;">
<strong style="font-size:13px; color:var(--blue);">📦 長方體Volume示意：長×闊×高（三維空間）</strong><br/>
<svg height="170" viewbox="0 0 220 170" width="220" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="80" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3" width="120" x="25" y="31"></rect><polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="25,31 41,15 161,15 145,31" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><polygon fill="#BFDBFE" points="145,31 161,15 161,95 145,111" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="85" y="127">l</text></svg>
<div style="font-size:9px; color:var(--gray); margin-top:3px;">長=8單位、闊=5單位、高=3單位。Volume=8×5×3=120立方單位。注意Volume是「三維」概念（cm³），不是Area（cm²）！</div>
</div>
<div style="display:flex; gap:10px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap; margin:8px 0;">
<div style="flex:1; min-width:200px;"><div style="text-align:center; margin:8px 0; padding:8px; background:#F0F9FF; border:1px solid var(--borderc); border-radius:5px;">
<strong style="font-size:13px; color:var(--blue);">🟦 正方體（特殊長方體）</strong><br/>
<svg height="200" viewbox="0 0 210 200" width="210" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="80" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3" width="80" x="25" y="41"></rect><polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="25,41 51,15 131,15 105,41" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><polygon fill="#BFDBFE" points="105,41 131,15 131,95 105,121" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="65" y="137">l</text></svg>
<div style="font-size:9px; color:var(--gray); margin-top:3px;">長=闊=高=5cm。V=a³=5³=125 cm³。正方體是長方體的特例。</div>
</div></div>
<div style="flex:1; min-width:200px;"><div style="text-align:center; margin:8px 0; padding:8px; background:#F0F9FF; border:1px solid var(--borderc); border-radius:5px;">
<strong style="font-size:13px; color:var(--blue);">📏 對比：Area（二維·cm²）</strong><br/>
<svg height="100" viewbox="0 0 190 100" width="190" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="60" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3" width="120" x="35" y="15"></rect><polyline fill="none" points="45,15 45,25 35,25" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2"></polyline><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="95" y="93">l</text><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="end" x="21" y="45">w</text></svg>
<div style="font-size:9px; color:var(--gray); margin-top:3px;">RectangleArea=l×w（二維）。千萬不要混淆：Area單位是cm²，Volume單位是cm³！</div>
</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點二：長方體Volume V = 長 × 闊 × 高 <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>長方體Volume公式：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>V = L × W × H</strong>（長 × 闊 × 高）<br/>
      ② 本質：底Area（長×闊）× 層數（高）<br/>
      ③ 延伸：已知 V 和其中兩邊，可求第三邊 → L = V ÷ W ÷ H<br/>
      ④ <strong>單位一致性</strong>：長闊高必須相同單位才能相乘！不同單位先換算
    </div>
<div style="margin:10px 0 0;text-align:center;">
<svg style="width:100%;max-width:400px;height:auto;" viewbox="0 0 400 180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<!-- Rectangular prism front face -->
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="95" rx="1" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="160" x="50" y="55"></rect>
<!-- Top face (L × W parallelogram) -->
<polygon fill="#BFDBFE" points="50,55 90,25 250,25 210,55" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2"></polygon>
<!-- Right face (W × H parallelogram) -->
<polygon fill="#93C5FD" points="210,55 250,25 250,120 210,150" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2"></polygon>
<!-- Dimension arrows -->
<line stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1.5" x1="50" x2="210" y1="164" y2="164"></line>
<polygon fill="#1A3C6D" points="50,164 58,160 58,168"></polygon>
<polygon fill="#1A3C6D" points="210,164 202,160 202,168"></polygon>
<line stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1.5" x1="40" x2="40" y1="150" y2="55"></line>
<polygon fill="#1A3C6D" points="40,150 36,142 44,142"></polygon>
<polygon fill="#1A3C6D" points="40,55 36,63 44,63"></polygon>
<line stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="1.5" x1="225" x2="255" y1="20" y2="20"></line>
<polygon fill="#1A3C6D" points="225,20 233,16 233,24"></polygon>
<polygon fill="#1A3C6D" points="255,20 247,16 247,24"></polygon>
<!-- Dimension labels -->
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="130" y="178">長 L</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="26" y="108">高 H</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="245" y="18">闊 W</text>
<!-- Formula box -->
<rect fill="#FEF3C7" height="40" rx="6" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5" width="105" x="280" y="75"></rect>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="13" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" x="332" y="100">V = L × W × H</text>
</svg>
<div style="font-size:9px;color:#6B7280;margin-top:2px;">長方體Volume = 長 × 闊 × 高。注意三邊必須單位一致才能相乘。</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">🪴 Trap引爆例題</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">長方體長 2 m、闊 50 cm、高 30 cm，Volume = ？cm³</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Common Mistake（60% 學生）</div><div class="eq">V = 2×50×30 = 3000 cm³ ❌</div><div class="why">單位未統一！2 m 是 200 cm，不是 2！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確解法</div><div class="eq">2 m = 200 cm<br/>V = 200×50×30<br/>= <strong>300,000 cm³</strong></div><div class="why">先統一單位 → 再乘！</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic：「長乘闊乘高，單位要一致——m 同 cm 唔可以混埋一齊乘！」</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 致命錯誤：不同單位直接相乘（2 m × 50 cm × 30 cm）→ 答案必定錯！</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 Worked Examples</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例4</td><td>長方體長 10 cm、闊 6 cm、高 4 cm。Volume = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例5</td><td>長方體長 1.5 m、闊 0.8 m、高 0.5 m。Volume = ？m³</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例6</td><td>長方體Volume 240 cm³，長 10 cm，闊 6 cm。高 = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:95px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點二 同步練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">9</td><td>長方體 12×5×8 cm。Volume = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">10</td><td>長方體 3 m × 2 m × 1.5 m。Volume = ？m³</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">11</td><td>長方體長 1 m、闊 40 cm、高 25 cm。Volume = ？cm³</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">12</td><td>長方體Volume 360 cm³，長 12 cm，高 5 cm。闊 = ？</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">13</td><td>長方體長 80 cm、闊 0.5 m、高 40 cm。Volume = ？m³（以Decimal作答）</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:95px;"></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<!-- ═══════════════ PAGE 4: KP3 + KP4 ═══════════════ -->
<div>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div style="text-align:center; margin:8px 0; padding:8px; background:#F0F9FF; border:1px solid var(--borderc); border-radius:5px;">
<strong style="font-size:13px; color:var(--blue);">📐 長方體Volume V = 長 × 闊 × 高 — 三維可視化</strong><br/>
<svg height="180" viewbox="0 0 250 180" width="250" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="80" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3" width="140" x="25" y="35"></rect><polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="25,35 45,15 185,15 165,35" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><polygon fill="#BFDBFE" points="165,35 185,15 185,95 165,115" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="95" y="131">l</text></svg>
<div style="font-size:9px; color:var(--gray); margin-top:3px;">標註：長(l)=10cm、闊(w)=6cm、高(h)=4cm。Volume=10×6×4=240 cm³。每個邊的單位必須一致！</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點三：正方體Volume V = a³ <span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 必考</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>正方體特殊公式：</strong><br/>
      ① 正方體是<strong>長=闊=高</strong>的長方體 → V = a × a × a = <strong>a³</strong><br/>
      ② a³ 意思是 a 自乘三次，<strong>不是 a×3</strong>（這是最Common Mistake！）<br/>
      ③ 例：邊長 5 cm → V = 5³ = 5×5×5 = 125 cm³<br/>
      ④ 已知Volume反求邊長：a = ∛V（開立方根，P5-P6 用試算/因式分解）
    </div>
<div style="margin:10px 0 0;text-align:center;">
<svg style="width:100%;max-width:380px;height:auto;" viewbox="0 0 380 180" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<!-- Cube front face -->
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="100" rx="1" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="100" x="70" y="55"></rect>
<!-- Top face -->
<polygon fill="#BFDBFE" points="70,55 110,25 210,25 170,55" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2"></polygon>
<!-- Right face -->
<polygon fill="#93C5FD" points="170,55 210,25 210,125 170,155" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2"></polygon>
<!-- 'a' labels -->
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="120" y="172">a</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="end" x="56" y="110">a</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="700" text-anchor="begin" x="215" y="42">a</text>
<!-- Equals sign on front face -->
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" x="120" y="100">a × a × a</text>
<!-- Formula box -->
<rect fill="#FEF3C7" height="45" rx="6" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5" width="110" x="250" y="72"></rect>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="14" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" x="305" y="100">V = a³</text>
</svg>
<div style="font-size:9px;color:#6B7280;margin-top:2px;">正方體 = 長 = 闊 = 高 = a，V = a × a × a = a³。注意 a³ ≠ a×3！</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex">
<div class="lf-ex-title">🪴 Trap引爆例題</div>
<div class="lf-ex-q">正方體邊長 4 cm，Volume = ？</div>
<div class="lf-ex-compare">
<div class="lf-ex-wrong"><div class="lf-ex-label">❌ Common Mistake（50% 學生）</div><div class="eq">V = 4×3 = 12 cm³ ❌</div><div class="why">把 a³ 誤當成 a×3！立方是自乘三次！</div></div>
<div class="lf-ex-right"><div class="lf-ex-label">✅ 正確解法</div><div class="eq">V = 4³ = 4×4×4<br/>= <strong>64 cm³</strong></div><div class="why">a³ = a×a×a，不是 a×3</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="mn">🧠 Mnemonic：「正方Volume a 三次方，4³ 係 64 唔係 12——自乘三次，唔係乘三！」</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 最致命錯誤：a³ 當作 a×3。4³ = 64，不是 12。每次都要寫 4×4×4=64。</div>
<div class="lf-h2">知識點三 例題 + 練習</div>
<table class="lf-qt">
<tr><th class="lf-qn">#</th><th>Question</th><th class="lf-qd">Difficulty</th><th>Answer Area</th></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例7</td><td>正方體邊長 9 cm，Volume = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">例8</td><td>正方體Volume 216 cm³，邊長 = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:95px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">14</td><td>正方體邊長 7 cm。Volume = ？</td><td class="qd d1">🌱</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">15</td><td>正方體邊長 0.5 m。Volume = ？m³</td><td class="qd d2">🌿</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:90px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">16</td><td>正方體Volume 125 cm³。邊長 = ？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:95px;"></td></tr>
<tr><td class="lf-qn">17</td><td>正方體邊長 15 cm。Volume = ？cm³；合多少 m³？</td><td class="qd d3">🌳</td><td class="lf-ans" style="min-height:95px;"></td></tr>
</table>
<div class="lf-kp">
<div style="display:flex; gap:10px; justify-content:center; flex-wrap:wrap; margin:8px 0;">
<div style="flex:1; min-width:180px;"><div style="text-align:center; margin:8px 0; padding:8px; background:#F0F9FF; border:1px solid var(--borderc); border-radius:5px;">
<strong style="font-size:13px; color:var(--blue);">正方體 4cm</strong><br/>
<svg height="180" viewbox="0 0 190 180" width="190" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="70" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3" width="70" x="25" y="38"></rect><polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="25,38 48,15 118,15 95,38" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><polygon fill="#BFDBFE" points="95,38 118,15 118,85 95,108" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="60" y="124">l</text></svg>
<div style="font-size:9px; color:var(--gray); margin-top:3px;">V=4³=64 cm³。注意：4³ ≠ 4×3！</div>
</div></div>
<div style="flex:1; min-width:180px;"><div style="text-align:center; margin:8px 0; padding:8px; background:#F0F9FF; border:1px solid var(--borderc); border-radius:5px;">
<strong style="font-size:13px; color:var(--blue);">正方體 5cm</strong><br/>
<svg height="200" viewbox="0 0 210 200" width="210" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="80" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3" width="80" x="25" y="41"></rect><polygon fill="#DBEAFE" points="25,41 51,15 131,15 105,41" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><polygon fill="#BFDBFE" points="105,41 131,15 131,95 105,121" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="3"></polygon><text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="13" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="65" y="137">l</text></svg>
<div style="font-size:9px; color:var(--gray); margin-top:3px;">V=5³=125 cm³。SA=6×5²=150 cm²。</div>
</div></div>
</div>
<div class="warn">⚠️ 注意：5³ = 5×5×5 = 125（不是 5×3=15）。a³ 是 a 自乘三次，不是 a 乘以 3！</div>
<div class="lf-kp-title">知識點四：表面Area（SA）VS Volume（V）<span class="lf-sspa-badge lf-sspa-high">🔴 SSPA 進階</span></div>
<div class="lf-kp-rules">
<strong>表面Area公式：</strong><br/>
      ① <strong>長方體表面Area</strong> = 2×(LW + LH + WH) = 2×(長×闊 + 長×高 + 闊×高)<br/>
      ② <strong>正方體表面Area</strong> = 6 × a²（6 個相同的Square面）<br/>
      ③ <strong>SA 單位是 cm²（平方米）</strong>，V 單位是 cm³（立方米）——<strong>單位不同！</strong><br/>
      ④ 常見考法：比較兩個3D Solid的 SA 和 V，或已知 SA 求邊長
    </div>
<div style="margin:10px 0 0;text-align:center;">
<svg style="width:100%;max-width:420px;height:auto;" viewbox="0 0 420 185" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
<!-- Prism front face (L×H) -->
<rect fill="#DBEAFE" height="90" rx="1" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2" width="160" x="40" y="55"></rect>
<!-- Top face (L×W) -->
<polygon fill="#BFDBFE" points="40,55 80,25 240,25 200,55" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2"></polygon>
<!-- Right face (W×H) -->
<polygon fill="#93C5FD" points="200,55 240,25 240,115 200,145" stroke="#1A3C6D" stroke-width="2"></polygon>
<!-- Face area labels on surfaces -->
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="120" y="108">L × H（前）</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(-15,130,45)" x="130" y="105">L × W（上）</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" transform="rotate(90,210,90)" x="210" y="90">W × H（側）</text>
<!-- Dimension labels -->
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="120" y="162">L</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="end" x="28" y="108">H</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="begin" x="250" y="35">W</text>
<!-- SA formula box -->
<rect fill="#FEF3C7" height="130" rx="6" stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1.5" width="130" x="275" y="28"></rect>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" x="340" y="50">表面Area (SA)</text>
<line stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1" x1="288" x2="392" y1="58" y2="58"></line>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="340" y="74">= 2 × (L×W + L×H + W×H)</text>
<line stroke="#C9A84C" stroke-width="1" x1="288" x2="392" y1="82" y2="82"></line>
<text fill="#16A34A" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="340" y="100">SA 單位：cm²</text>
<text fill="#DC2626" font-size="10" font-weight="700" text-anchor="middle" x="340" y="118">V 單位：cm³</text>
<text fill="#1A3C6D" font-size="11" font-weight="900" text-anchor="middle" x="340" y="148">⚠ 單位不同！</text>
</svg>
<div style="font-size:9px;color:#6B7280;margin-top:2px;">SA = 6 個面的Area之和。每種面出現 2 次（前/後、上/下、左/右）。</div>
</div>
</div>
<div class="sc">
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">V</div><div class="t">Volume</div><div class="d">長×闊×高<br/>單位 cm³</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">SA</div><div class="t">表面Area</div><div class="d">2(LW+LH+WH)<br/>單位 cm²</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">L</div><div class="t">總棱長</div><div class="d">4(L+W+H)<br/>單位 cm</div></div>
<div class="sc-i"><div class="n">⚠</div><div class="t">別混淆</div><div class="d">三種公式<br/>三種單位！</div></div>
</div>
<div class="lf-ex"><div class="lf-ex-title">例題</div><div class="lf-ex-q">例9：長方體 8×5×3 cm。求 (a) Volume (b) 表面Area。</div></div>
