            </div>
            <div>
                <div class="lf-trap-q">A steel cube with an edge length of 10 cm is melted and recast into a rectangular prism with a base area of 40 cm². What is its height?</div>
                <div class="lf-trap-wrong">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Common Mistake:</span> 40÷40=1cm
                </div>
                <div class="trap-correct">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Correct Answer:</span> 10×10×10=1000 cm³÷40=25 cm
                </div>
                <div class="trap-tip">
                    <span class="lf-ex-label">Trap Analysis:</span> T1+T3 Conservation of volume: cube volume ÷ rectangular prism base area = height
                </div>

            </div>
